      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "To take care of a patient presenting with chronic pelvic pain requires a long-term approach considering all the organic, psychological and sexological aspects of the problem. To relieve the patient, it could be very useful to analyse the doctor-patient relationship. Most probably a multidisciplinary team with all the colleagues caring for the patient is the best place to discuss these items."},
